[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.5]
\draw (0,0) -- (7,0) node[midway,below,font=\small] {$7\text{ cm}$};
\draw (7,0) -- (7,5) node[midway,right,font=\small] {$5\text{ cm}$};
\draw (7,5) -- (3,5) node[midway,above,font=\small] {$4\text{ cm}$};
\draw (3,5) -- (3,9) node[midway,right,font=\small] {$4\text{ cm}$};
\draw (3,9) -- (0,9) node[midway,above,font=\small] {$3\text{ cm}$};
\draw (0,9) -- (0,0) node[midway,left,font=\small] {$9\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
All angles are right angles.
What is the area of this figure, in $\text{cm}^2$?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.36]
\draw (0,0) -- (13,0) node[midway,below,font=\small] {$13\text{ m}$};
\draw (13,0) -- (13,4) node[midway,right,font=\small] {$4\text{ m}$};
\draw (13,4) -- (8,4);
\draw (8,4) -- (8,10) node[midway,right,font=\small] {$6\text{ m}$};
\draw (8,10) -- (0,10) node[midway,above,font=\small] {$8\text{ m}$};
\draw (0,10) -- (0,0) node[midway,left,font=\small] {$10\text{ m}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
All angles are right angles.
One side is not labelled.
What is the area of this figure, in $\text{m}^2$?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.38]
\draw (0,0) -- (11,0) node[midway,below,font=\small] {$11\text{ km}$};
\draw (11,0) -- (11,5) node[midway,right,font=\small] {$5\text{ km}$};
\draw (11,5) -- (7,5) node[midway,above,font=\small] {$4\text{ km}$};
\draw (7,5) -- (7,8) node[midway,right,font=\small] {$3\text{ km}$};
